ithubusercontent.com/u/101306480?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandan2003/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandan2003/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandan2003/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandan2003/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandan2003","id":101306480,"login":"nandan2003","node_id":"U_kgDOBgnQcA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandan2003/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandan2003/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandan2003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandan2003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandan2003/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandan2003","user_view_type":"public"},"created_at":"2026-01-07T07:44:19Z","event":"cross-referenced","source":{"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"## Description\r\nFixes #33649.\r\n\r\nPreviously, `jax.export` would drop the `memory_kind` attribute (e.g., `pinned_host`) during the export process because the underlying `HloSharding` format does not support this metadata. This caused exported functions to lose critical memory placement information when re-imported.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n- Modified the `Exported` class in `jax/_src/export/_export.py` to store `in_memory_kinds` and `out_memory_kinds`.\r\n- Updated `export()` to extract `memory_kind` from input/output shardings before lowering to HLO.\r\n- Updated `in_shardings_jax()` and `_hlo_sharding_to_named_sharding` to restore the correct `memory_kind` upon reconstruction.\r\n\r\n## Tests\r\n- Added `test_export_preserves_memory_kind` to `tests/export_test.py` which verifies that `pinned_host` is preserved after an export roundtrip.","closed_at":"2026-01-07T15:33:06Z","comments":9,"com